{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:ac37a1574ceb6b2a","name":"The Servo Seven","source":{"id":"source:reference-ac37a1574ceb6b2a","title":"The Servo Seven","revision":24548,"timestamp":"2024-11-03T19:30:51Z","sha256":"b9b1aea691a489f0280e52f89d603469548366ae533f54ed4ea8cc5373b8c6c1","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24548","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Servo%20Seven&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-ac37a1574ceb6b2a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Servo Seven is group of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," that captured a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," manufacturing facility, holding it for two weeks. They become folk heroes to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," as well as to those beings who feel the second-class status of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," is unfair. The members of The Servo Seven are eventually caught and deactivated. But their act of defiance lives on. The group's insignia- a stylized gear emblazoned with a 7- is used by both sides as a symbol. Anti-",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," forces apply it when striking at ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," and claiming revenge. Pro-",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," activists use the emblem when progress is made in the quest for equal rights for all sentients.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
